/*
 * One case per diagnostic code, each raising the code it is named for in
 * docs/errors/. A case is the minimal source that reaches the check, and its
 * golden is the diagnostic the compiler produces for it -- so the snippet the
 * documentation quotes is one the suite keeps compiling, and a code that stops
 * being reachable fails here rather than going quietly stale.
